[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","question_text":"蝉圈圈怎么用？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":6,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"66cde85cbc46f397a3b249f0d404174e2c7eef0aa735124512897d99dcb30ba5","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 蝉圈圈（商家达人CRM工具）完整使用步骤\n蝉圈圈是**PC端网页工具**（没有手机APP），商家用来找达人、建联、管理寄样、追踪带货数据，支持抖音/小红书/快手/视频号，底层是蝉妈妈数据。\n## 一、前期准备\n1. 打开官网：**kolkoc.com**，账号密码/验证码登录；也可以从抖店服务市场订购开通权限\n2. 绑定店铺：把你的抖店、小红书店铺等授权绑定，同步商品、订单数据\n3. 录入商品：添加要推广的产品，设置佣金、坑位费、寄样政策\n\n## 二、找达人（核心第一步）\n进入【达人合作 → 找达人】页面，3种方式选达人：\n1. **AI智能推荐**：填入你的类目、商品，系统自动计算匹配分，推荐适合带货达人，可筛选粉丝量级、带货GMV、互动率、品类\n2. **竞品线索**：输入竞品品牌名，直接扒出过竞品带货的达人，看他们的销量数据，对标挖达人\n3. **商品线索**：粘贴商品链接/关键词，找到带同类产品的达人\n\n筛选出来合适达人，**加入邀约池**。\n\n## 三、批量建联达人（AI商务插件）\n1. 安装蝉圈圈AI商务插件，支持在精选联盟、蒲公英等平台一键把达人捞进邀约池\n2. 在邀约池：批量勾选达人，设置**预设邀约话术、商品、佣金、寄样规则**\n3. 批量发送私信；系统自动回收达人回复、联系方式，在【我的达人】统一管理状态：待联系/已发/已回复/拒绝，不用手动表格记录\n\n> 注意：遵守平台私信规则，不要违规群发。\n\n## 四、样品&合作全流程管理\n1. **样品管理**：新建寄样单，填写收货达人、快递单号；跟踪状态：待审核→已寄出→达人签收→履约发布，记录样品成本\n2. **合作管理**：记录坑位费、佣金、排期；达人发布视频/直播后，系统自动抓取作品\n3. **内容资产**：合作达人视频可无水印保存入库，AI拉片拆解爆款脚本结构，沉淀素材库\n\n## 五、数据复盘\n【数据概览】看全渠道汇总：合作达人GMV、订单、退款、团队商务业绩、达人排行榜；支持按时间段筛选，自动生成达人营销结案数据，替代手工Excel统计\n\n## 六、种草计划（小红书种草用）\n新建种草项目，设置曝光目标、预算、达人画像；添加种草达人，监控笔记曝光、种草引流效果，追踪种草带来的转化\n\n## 简单一句话SOP\n登录绑定店铺 → 筛选达人（智能推荐/竞品达人）→ 达人加入邀约池批量BD → 寄样流程跟进 → 达人发布后监控内容与成交 → 后台看数据复盘\n\n\n\n需要我给你一套蝉圈圈批量邀约达人的通用私信模板吗？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:1","title":"找达人合作的平台有哪些?蝉圈圈跨平台筛选建联实操 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:2","title":"商家找达人有哪些渠道?蝉圈圈5大高效实操策略 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1449.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1449.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:3","title":"达人建联完整流程是什么?精准筛选与批量邀约SOP - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:4","title":"如何做好618达人合作复盘?用好蝉圈圈给你节省80%的时间 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/927","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/927","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:5","title":"蝉圈圈 | COONAV电商运营导航","raw_url":"https://www.coonav.com/sites/37162.html","normalized_url":"https://www.coonav.com/sites/37162.html","host":"www.coonav.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:6","title":"还在无效种草?一文教你如何高效进行营销内容种草? - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1080","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1080","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:7","title":"蝉圈圈 - 一站式多平台达人营销及种草解决方案","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/bridge","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:8","title":"关于我们 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/other/about.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:9","title":"品牌商家抖音达人营销管理利器-蝉圈圈 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1059.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1059.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:10","title":"登录入口 - 蝉圈圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/login","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:11","title":"抖店服务市场-服务详情","raw_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?from=open_partner_svcList&service_id=32167","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.jinritemai.com/detail?from=open_partner_svcList&service_id=32167","host":"fuwu.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:12","title":"快手服务市场-快手电商官网","raw_url":"https://fuwu.kwaixiaodian.com/new/detail?id=15494563971339","normalized_url":"https://fuwu.kwaixiaodian.com/new/detail?id=15494563971339","host":"fuwu.kwaixiaodian.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-85a7f451643049b097c4410b8c13f8ce:18","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","question_text":"蝉圈圈怎么用？","category":"品牌认知型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":11,"official_events":7,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"fb4b40eafe0d322e3617a08d90c0179d8518ecc6752d7f9b29c31917685ee21c","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":["explanation_accuracy","positioning_accuracy"],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 蝉圈圈（商家达人营销SaaS）完整使用流程\n蝉圈圈是**品牌商家用的达人CRM工具**，用来一站式找达人、建联、寄样、监控内容、复盘带货/种草数据，支持抖音、小红书、快手、视频号，底层是蝉妈妈数据。\n> 入口：网页版 kolkoc.com，需要商家账号登录，付费SaaS工具，个人达人一般不用。\n\n## ✅ 第一步：账号初始化\n1. 注册登录蝉圈圈后台，绑定你的**抖店/小红书店铺**，授权数据同步\n2. 设置商品、类目、佣金、样品政策、合作话术模板\n3. 团队添加子账号，分配商务、运营权限，多人协作\n\n## ✅ 第二步：找达人（核心）\n进入【达人合作 → 找达人】，3种方式捞达人：\n1. **AI智能推荐**：填商品类目、目标粉丝量级、客单价，AI自动算匹配分，每日推送适配达人\n2. **竞品线索**：输入竞品品牌名，直接拉出所有给竞品带货/种草的达人，看他们的成交数据\n3. **商品线索**：粘贴商品链接，找到带同类产品出过单的博主\n\n筛选条件：平台、粉丝区间、带货GMV、互动率、是否留联系方式、坑位费、类目标签。\n选中意向达人 → **加入邀约池**。\n\n## ✅ 第三步：AI批量建联邀约（AI商务插件）\n1. 安装蝉圈圈浏览器插件，支持从精选联盟、蒲公英等平台一键捞达人进邀约池\n2. 在邀约池，选定达人、绑定推广商品，选择预设话术，**批量发送私信**\n3. 系统自动回收达人回复、联系方式，状态自动更新（待沟通/已读/同意/拒绝）\n4. 同意合作的达人，转入【我的达人】资源库存档，沉淀企业达人资产\n\n## ✅ 第四步：样品&合作全流程管理\n1. **寄样管理**：新建样品单，填写收件达人、快递单号，系统追踪物流，标记待审核、寄出、签收、履约状态\n2. **合作项目管理**：创建种草/带货计划，设置目标曝光、预算；记录坑位费、佣金、约定发布时间\n3. **内容监控**：达人发布视频/直播后，自动抓取作品，监控播放、成交，爆单提醒；视频素材一键存入内容资产库\n\n## ✅ 第五步：数据复盘\n【数据概览】看整体GMV、订单、达人排行榜、退款、种草曝光数据；\n可按项目/商品/达人导出报表，统计商务团队绩效，复盘哪些达人、内容转化更好。\n\n## ✅ 附加AI功能\n- AI拉片：拆解爆款视频脚本、镜头结构，生成脚本参考\n- 种草双曲线追踪：监控种草曝光和后续销量变化，评估种草效果\n\n## ⚠️ 重要提醒\n1. 蝉圈圈**是商家工具**，达人账号不能用来接单；\n2. AI批量私信需要遵守抖音/小红书平台私信规则，避免违规限流；\n3. 属于付费SaaS，不同版本功能权限不一样，试用可联系客服。\n\n\n要不要我给你一套蝉圈圈达人建联的**私信话术模板**，直接复制使用？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-7774115fb93140009b58eea99114c26e:1","title":"找达人合作的平台有哪些?蝉圈圈跨平台筛选建联实操 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1398.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-7774115fb93140009b58eea99114c26e:2","title":"商家找达人有哪些渠道?蝉圈圈5大高效实操策略 - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1449.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1449.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-7774115fb93140009b58eea99114c26e:3","title":"达人建联完整流程是什么?精准筛选与批量邀约SOP - 蝉圈圈-达播学习圈","raw_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","normalized_url":"https://www.kolkoc.com/news/1304.html","host":"www.kolkoc.com","source_type":"official","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-7774115fb93140009b58eea99114c26e:4","title":"如何做好618达人合作复盘?用好蝉圈圈给你节省80%的时间 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/927","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/927","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0109","question_id":"CQ-Q0109","citation_id":"smp-7774115fb93140009b58eea99114c26e:5","title":"蝉圈圈 | COONAV电商运营导航","raw_url":"https://www.coonav.com/sites/37162.html","normalized_url":"https://www.coonav.com/sites/37162.html","host":"www.coonav.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-202610